{"abstract":[{"text":"Dynamics can be associated either with a note or a general musical direction. To avoid inconsistencies between","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and among the letter abbreviations for dynamics (what is sf vs. sfz, standing alone or with a trailing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dynamic that is not always piano), we use the actual letters as the names of these dynamic elements. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other-dynamics element allows other dynamic marks that are not covered here. Dynamics elements may also be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"combined to create marks not covered by a single element, such as sfmp.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/init(id:items:position:font:color:halign:valign:placement:underline:overline:lineThrough:enclosure:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/color","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/enclosure","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/font","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/halign","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/id","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/items","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/lineThrough","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/overline","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/placement","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/position","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/underline","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/valign"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-P